note "eval-coverage-4 first reference, read frame by frame: at 1.5 and 90 Hz the pill (18 px art, title) morphs into the media card (216 x 120 art decoded at 324 x 180, drawn whole on every morph frame); the track change draws both images under the dissolve for 13 frames, then the new one alone; the card morphs back into the pill on close and the pill's art swaps again; the clock never moves"
